    <title>
        feat(mistral): add Z.ai GLM-5.3 and fix GLM-5.2 reasoning efforts (#7…
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-18T01:49:37Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15650945?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>jope35</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/jope35</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;feat(mistral): add Z.ai GLM-5.3 and fix GLM-5.2 reasoning efforts (#7334)

Add zai-glm-5-3 hosted by Mistral ($1.40/$4.40 per MTok, $0.14 cached
input), base_model zhipuai/glm-5.3, effort low|high|max.

Fix zai-glm-5-2 reasoning_options: Mistral accepts reasoning_effort=none
(thinking fully disabled, verified live), so values are none|high|max.
low|medium map to high and xhigh maps to max per the GLM-5.2 native
mapping, so aliases stay excluded.&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
